{"created": "2026-02-14T14:28:49.234326+00:00", "modified": "2026-02-14T14:28:49.616906+00:00", "id": 18460279, "conceptrecid": "18460278", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18460279", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.18460278", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18460279", "metadata": {"title": "Genome-wide single-cell perturbation screens with VIPerturb-seq", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18460279", "publication_date": "2026-02-02", "description": "<p>These files represent new datasets generated in the preprint \"Genome-wide single-cell perturbation screens with VIPerturb-seq\". See below for the description of the files, and the preprint for full details.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><code>multimodal_cell_line_mixing_pilot.rds</code> - A Seurat object containing transcriptome, guide-barcodes, protein (ADT), and hashing (HTO) data for the cell line mixing VIPerturb-seq pilot described in Figure 2 of the preprint.</p>\n<p><code>genome_wide_screen_binX.rds</code> - 3 Seurat objects containing transcriptome and guide-barcodes data for the genome-wide VIPerturb-seq experiment described in Figure 3 of the preprint. Each object contains all non-targeting cells in the dataset and a random subset of perturbations, as described in <code>genome_wide_manifest.txt</code> .</p>\n<p><code>genome_wide_manifest.txt</code> - A table describing which perturbations are included in which objects for the genome-wide experiment.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><code>genome_wide_filtered.rds</code> - A Seurat object containing transcriptome and guide-barcodes for a subset of 6,724 perturbations from the genome-wide experiment with fingerprints passing filtering.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><code>vimentin_screen.rds</code> - A Seurat object containing transcriptome and guide-barcodes data for VIPerturb-seq screen for regulators of vimentin described in Figure 4 of the preprint.&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Bradu, Alexandra", "affiliation": "New York Genome Center", "orcid": "0000-0002-2237-034X"}, {"name": "Blair, Jo